{"term": {"label": "心", "occurrences": 5, "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "2B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gongsun-chou-ii", "title": "公孫丑下", "description": "孟子曰：「天時不如地利，地利不如人和。三里之城，七里之郭，環而攻之而不勝。夫環而攻之，必有得天時者矣；然而不勝者，是天時不如地利也。城非不高也，池非不深也，兵革非不堅利也，米粟非不多也；委而去之，是地利不如人和也。故曰：域民不以封疆之界，固國不以山谿之險，威天下不以兵革之利。得道者多助，失道者寡助。寡助之至，親戚畔之；"}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "三", "id": "三"}, {"form": "予", "id": "予"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "何", "id": "何"}, {"form": "公", "id": "公"}, {"form": "出", "id": "出"}, {"form": "去", "id": "去"}, {"form": "宿", "id": "宿"}, {"form": "富", "id": "富"}, {"form": "尹", "id": "尹"}, {"form": "後", "id": "後"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "敢", "id": "敢"}, {"form": "欲", "id": "欲"}, {"form": "用", "id": "用"}, {"form": "臣", "id": "臣"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.8935421635379974, "source": "尹", "target": "後"}, {"weight": 1.6422277352570913, "source": "尹", "target": "臣"}, {"weight": 0.3429447511268304, "source": "尹", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.0668635903535293, "source": "尹", "target": "予"}, {"weight": 1.4723286984616937, "source": "予", "target": "何"}, {"weight": 1.7600107709134747, "source": "予", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 1.3545456628053103, "source": "予", "target": "富"}, {"weight": 1.3545456628053103, "source": "予", "target": "欲"}, {"weight": 1.0668635903535293, "source": "予", "target": "三"}, {"weight": 1.3545456628053103, "source": "予", "target": "出"}, {"weight": 1.0668635903535293, "source": "予", "target": "宿"}, {"weight": 0.5072478024181067, "source": "予", "target": "後"}, {"weight": 1.0668635903535293, "source": "予", "target": "用"}, {"weight": 2.0476928433652555, "source": "敢", "target": "宿"}, {"weight": 1.488077055429833, "source": "敢", "target": "後"}, {"weight": 3.4339872044851463, "source": "出", "target": "三"}, {"weight": 3.4339872044851463, "source": "出", "target": "宿"}, {"weight": 2.181224235989778, "source": "出", "target": "後"}, {"weight": 1.0360919316867758, "source": "心", "target"